# Hospital System — Cline rules

## What this project is

Hospital Management System: React 18 + Tailwind CSS v4 frontend (`frontend/`),
Laravel 11 API backend (`backend/`), MySQL database. Frontend and backend
talk over `/api/*` (Vite proxies to `http://localhost:8000` in development).

## Hard rules — do not break these

1. **Never modify `backend/` code.** The business logic, algorithms and
   workflow were preserved from the original system on purpose:
   - Passwords: `sha1(md5($password))` (`app/Support/HisPassword.php`)
   - Record numbers: `substr(str_shuffle($charset), 1, $length)`
     (`app/Support/HisCode.php`)
   - Doctors sign in by doctor ID (`doc_number`), admins by email
   - Discharge sets `pat_discharge_status` + `pat_walk_out_date`
   - All 18 `his_*` tables keep their original column names
2. **Never modify the `DATABASE FILE/` dump.** It is the legacy reference
   schema and can be imported directly.
3. **Frontend work only** unless the user explicitly asks otherwise. API
   contracts (routes, request/response shapes) are fixed — build the UI
   against them, do not change the backend to fit the UI.

## Running the project

Node/npm are not installed globally on this machine. A portable Node.js
lives in the home folder — always run commands with it on PATH:

```bash
export PATH="$HOME/hospital-tools/node-v22.22.0-darwin-arm64/bin:$PATH"
```

Frontend dev server:

```bash
cd frontend && npm run dev     # http://localhost:5173
```

Backend (needs PHP 8.2+, Composer, MySQL installed first):

```bash
cd backend && php artisan serve    # http://localhost:8000
```

## Design system

The UI follows a "chart room" direction: light clinical surfaces, hairline
borders, pen-ink text, deep scrub-teal primary used only for actions and
active states. IBM Plex Sans for text; IBM Plex Mono strictly for record
codes (patient/lab/surgery numbers). Semantic tokens only (`bg-primary`,
`text-muted-foreground`) — never raw hex values. Components come from
shadcn/ui (Base UI build) in `frontend/src/components/ui/` — compose them,
do not hand-roll styled divs.

Skills for UI work live in `.agents/skills/` (shadcn, interface-design).
Read them before changing the design.
